[en.FOCUS_C12_CONTACT_THE_RESISTANCE]
Join resistance

[en.FOCUS_C12_CONTACT_THE_RESISTANCE_desc]
Although my understanding of resistance leaders like Twilight Gleam and Starlight Radiance is far less than that of my sisters, since they are friends of my sisters, they also deserve a certain degree of my trust. By sending an encrypted telegram, I will convey my willingness to fight alongside them—as long as they don’t stand in my way.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CONTACT_THE_RESISTANCE]
加入联络抵抗组织

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CONTACT_THE_RESISTANCE_desc]
余晖烁烁和星光熠熠等抵抗军领袖已经吹响了反击帝国的号角，我们将紧随他们的步伐，并肩作战。
